# Normalise line endings. The project lead develops on Windows; CI, EAS Build
# and any future contributor on macOS/Linux should see LF regardless.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ⚠ PowerShell 5.1 needs CRLF. `* text=auto eol=lf` above gave `tools/dev-phone.ps1`
# LF endings, and 5.1 then refused to parse its here-strings — six "Unexpected
# token" errors pointing at prose inside a string, on a borrowed Windows machine
# with a phone plugged in and nothing else wrong (2026-08-22).
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pmtiles binary
*.mbtiles binary
*.pbf binary
